Subject: [PATCH net-next 08/14] net: stmmac: handle integrated PCS
 phy_intf_sel separately
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Disposition: inline
Message-Id: <E1vhoSX-00000005H1x-0N69@rmk-PC.armlinux.org.uk>
